1
00:00:09,559 --> 00:00:14,594
Who do you think I am?
One look at your face and I knew you got flustered.

2
00:00:14,594 --> 00:00:16,875
Why didn't you tell me sooner?

3
00:00:16,875 --> 00:00:19,902
It's not like I wanted to pry.

4
00:00:20,081 --> 00:00:23,359
You call that not prying?
You never tell me anything, you little shit.

5
00:00:23,359 --> 00:00:26,524
Since that whole Maprang and Base mess,
I've been pissed as hell.

6
00:00:27,322 --> 00:00:29,961
Did you apologize to the kid yet?

7
00:00:30,759 --> 00:00:35,292
Not yet. I'm still shocked.
He's probably mad at me, so he went to his friend's.

8
00:00:36,171 --> 00:00:38,647
Then go apologize to him.

9
00:00:39,526 --> 00:00:43,830
And from now on…
whatever you two do is up to you.

10
00:00:44,042 --> 00:00:45,216
What's that supposed to mean?

11
00:00:45,493 --> 00:00:47,442
Nothing. I'm leaving.

12
00:00:49,656 --> 00:00:55,562
Night! Night!
Hey, damn it!

13
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:57,700
(2 Days Later)

14
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:12,880
So you two made up already?
Mm.

15
00:01:13,119 --> 00:01:19,880
So where are you going?
Back home or to your brother's place?

16
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:28,200
Gun's place.

17
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:36,535
Okay then. If anything happens, call me.

18
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:52,147
You done?

19
00:01:52,147 --> 00:01:57,079
Yeah, I'm done.
